            "reviewBody": "I'm not having a good day. At all. So, after my monsterish morning, I came home and looked up a drink recipe I'd not tried yet. This was the winner. And boy, what a winner. I like this very much. I did double the vodka, but only because I like my drinks stronger. Little fruity with a touch of tart. Very nice."
